WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.936
"Do you not recognize your king?"

2
00:00:02.937 --> 00:00:06.925
A man pushed his face close to Mandy.

3
00:00:06.926 --> 00:00:09.556
"This is King Louis XIV!

4
00:00:09.557 --> 00:00:12.402
He is the greatest king in the world!"

5
00:00:12.403 --> 00:00:16.345
"Louis who?" Vinnie whispered to Mandy.

6
00:00:16.346 --> 00:00:20.154
She pinched his arm to make him keep quiet.

7
00:00:20.155 --> 00:00:24.024
"That’s enough, my Duke," the king said.

8
00:00:24.025 --> 00:00:27.085
"The children will go to their work now."

9
00:00:27.086 --> 00:00:32.433
King Louis waved his hand and walked away very slowly.

10
00:00:32.434 --> 00:00:39.073
His followers moved as slow as snails too.

11
00:00:39.074 --> 00:00:43.077
Vinnie giggled and pointed to their pointy shoes.

12
00:00:43.078 --> 00:00:47.273
"No wonder they can’t walk fast," he said.

13
00:00:47.274 --> 00:00:51.021
"Shh!" said Mandy.

14
00:00:51.022 --> 00:00:54.418
The women wore long full skirts.

15
00:00:54.419 --> 00:00:59.303
The men wore wide lace neckties and long coats.

16
00:00:59.304 --> 00:01:05.095
Both the men and women wore big curly wigs.

17
00:01:05.096 --> 00:01:07.349
"Didn’t you hear the king?

18
00:01:07.350 --> 00:01:11.527
Go to your work!" the gardener shouted again.

19
00:01:11.528 --> 00:01:15.697
His voice was back now that the king had moved on.

20
00:01:15.698 --> 00:01:21.153
"But, sir, we do not know where to go," said Mandy.

21
00:01:21.154 --> 00:01:25.833
"We . . . uh . . . we are new here."

22
00:01:25.834 --> 00:01:30.070
The old man sighed and pointed to the next building.

23
00:01:30.071 --> 00:01:33.543
"Go inside to the kitchen and ask for Mary!"

24
00:01:33.544 --> 00:01:35.951
The children thanked him.

25
00:01:35.952 --> 00:01:39.090
Vinnie and Mandy headed for the kitchen.

26
00:01:39.091 --> 00:01:44.195
But someone was watching them.

27
00:01:44.196 --> 00:01:45.762
"So we’re in France.

28
00:01:45.763 --> 00:01:49.881
Then this place must be—," Mandy began.

29
00:01:49.882 --> 00:01:55.809
"Versailles!" A girl jumped out from behind some tomato plants.

30
00:01:55.810 --> 00:02:00.501
"Ahhh!" Vinnie and Mandy screamed.

31
00:02:00.502 --> 00:02:05.315
"Oh, I’m sorry!" the girl giggled.

32
00:02:05.316 --> 00:02:07.802
She was about Mandy’s age.

33
00:02:07.803 --> 00:02:12.004
"I’m Helene." She pointed to the old man.

34
00:02:12.005 --> 00:02:13.588
"He is my father.

35
00:02:13.589 --> 00:02:18.141
He’s the gardener of the king’s kitchen garden."

36
00:02:18.142 --> 00:02:21.533
The children introduced themselves.

37
00:02:21.534 --> 00:02:25.346
"Do you work here at Versailles?" asked Vinnie.

38
00:02:25.347 --> 00:02:27.060
Helene nodded.

39
00:02:27.061 --> 00:02:29.747
"I was born here," she said.

40
00:02:29.748 --> 00:02:34.084
"My family lives here to serve the king."

41
00:02:34.085 --> 00:02:37.827
"What about school?" asked Mandy.

42
00:02:37.828 --> 00:02:40.251
Helene laughed loudly.

43
00:02:40.252 --> 00:02:43.245
"You’re so funny, Mandy.

44
00:02:43.246 --> 00:02:45.945
I don’t go to school.

45
00:02:45.946 --> 00:02:47.472
You are new here.

46
00:02:47.473 --> 00:02:49.615
Let me show you around."

47
00:02:49.616 --> 00:02:57.417
The children saw orange trees and more gardens along the way.

48
00:02:57.418 --> 00:03:01.280
"How many gardens are there?" asked Vinnie.

49
00:03:01.281 --> 00:03:04.077
He was already tired of walking.

50
00:03:04.078 --> 00:03:08.744
"Lots and lots," giggled Helene.

51
00:03:08.745 --> 00:03:16.278
"And we have over 1,300 fountains, 300 statues and vases, and . . ."

52
00:03:16.279 --> 00:03:19.906
"What?" Vinnie stared at her.

53
00:03:19.907 --> 00:03:23.742
"There are 1,300 fountains?"

54
00:03:23.743 --> 00:03:27.180
He was thinking of the fountain in the photo.

55
00:03:27.181 --> 00:03:33.024
"How will we ever find the right one to get us home?" he wondered to himself.

56
00:03:33.025 --> 00:03:36.604
Mandy was thinking of something else.

57
00:03:36.605 --> 00:03:42.068
"And all of this is for just one person?" she asked.

58
00:03:42.069 --> 00:03:44.939
"Yes, it’s all for the king of France.

59
00:03:44.940 --> 00:03:47.069
He can have whatever he wants."

60
00:03:47.070 --> 00:03:49.470
Helene smiled again.

61
00:03:49.471 --> 00:03:53.282
"Where do your parents work at Versailles?"

62
00:03:53.283 --> 00:03:57.519
"Uh, well . . ." Vinnie thought quickly.

63
00:03:57.520 --> 00:04:02.211
He remembered that Dad went to buy something for the roof.

64
00:04:02.212 --> 00:04:05.614
"Our parents are working on the roof."

65
00:04:05.615 --> 00:04:08.827
Helene looked up at the top of the palace.

66
00:04:08.828 --> 00:04:10.812
She seemed puzzled.

67
00:04:10.813 --> 00:04:15.213
"Maybe we can look for them later," she said, shrugging.

68
00:04:15.214 --> 00:04:24.518
Vinnie and Mandy looked at each other and smiled.

